                                                 "career":  "Magha’s association with authority and legacy can suit work involving leadership, administration, government, institutions, heritage, management, or responsibility for others. Wednesday’s influence also supports communication, analysis, commerce, writing, coordination, and skill-based work. Vishti Karana suggests persistence when handling competition, obstacles, emergencies, or difficult assignments, though tact is important to prevent avoidable conflict. A precise career direction, timing of advancement, or assessment of professional yogas cannot be made without the D1 chart, house placements, planetary strengths, and dasha periods.",
